## 2. Technical Architecture & UI Features

- **Search & Real-time Filter**: Instant search matching query string against persistent SQLite database via `ClipboardService.search_history(query)`.
- **Tab Filters**: Toggle between **All**, **Pinned**, and **Favorites** views dynamically.
- **Empty & Loading States**: Styled `empty_label` displayed automatically when history is empty or when search queries yield 0 matches.
- **Full Detail Preview Dialog**: Double-clicking an item card or clicking preview opens `ClipboardPreviewDialog`, displaying un-truncated text content, word/character/line counts, and SHA-256 hash.
- **Keyboard Shortcuts**:
  - `Ctrl+F`: Instantly focuses and selects text in search bar.
  - `Delete`: Deletes the currently selected history entry.
  - `Enter` / `Return`: Copies selected item text to system clipboard.
  - `Esc`: Clears active search filter and returns focus to list.
- **Clear History Confirmation**: `ClipboardClearConfirmDialog` prompts user confirmation before clearing history, preserving pinned items by default.
- **Exporting History**: Export history items directly to JSON, CSV, or double-newline delimited TXT files via `QFileDialog`.

